{
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Internal developer platform on multi-cluster Kubernetes",
  "description": "Product teams deploy to namespaces on shared Kubernetes clusters in two regions. A platform layer provides ingress, a service mesh, secrets, policy, a delivery pipeline and observability. Namespaces are the unit of tenancy: each has its own quota, network policy and identity.",
